          "question": {
            "text": "Consider the following two propositions:\n$\\mathrm{P}_1: \\sim(p \\rightarrow \\sim q)$\n$P_2:(p \\wedge \\sim q) \\wedge((\\sim p) \\vee q)$\nIf the proposition $p \\rightarrow((\\sim p) \\vee q)$ is evaluated as FALSE, then :",
