            }
          ],
          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "Given propositions $\\mathrm{P}_1: \\sim(\\mathrm{p} \\rightarrow \\sim \\mathrm{q})$\n$\\mathrm{P}_2:(p \\wedge \\sim q) \\wedge((\\sim p) \\vee q)$\nRequired table is shown below.\r\n\\(\\begin{array}{|l|l|l|l|l|l|l|l|l|l|l|}\r\n\\hline \\mathbf{p} & \\mathbf{q} & \\sim p & \\sim q & \\sim p \\vee q & p \\rightarrow(\\sim(p \\vee q) & p \\rightarrow \\sim q & \\sim(p \\rightarrow \\sim q) & p \\wedge \\sim q & p_2 \\\\\r\n\\hline \\text { T } & \\text { T } & \\text { F } & \\text { F } & \\text { T } & \\text { T } & \\text { F } & \\text { T } & \\text { F } & \\text { F } \\\\\r\n\\hline \\text { T } & \\text { F } & \\text { F } & \\text { T } & \\text { F } & \\text { F } & \\text { T } & \\text { F } & \\text { T } & \\text { F } \\\\\r\n\\hline \\text { F } & \\text { T } & \\text { T } & \\text { F } & \\text { T } & \\text { T } & \\text { T } & \\text { F } & \\text { F } & \\text { F } \\\\\r\n\\hline \\text { F } & \\text { F } & \\text { T } & \\text { T } & \\text { T } & \\text { T } & \\text { T } & \\text { F } & \\text { F } & \\text { F } \\\\\r\n\\hline\r\n\\end{array}\\)\r\n\\(p \\rightarrow(\\sim p \\vee q)\\) is \\(F\\) when \\(p\\) is true \\(q\\) is false From table \\(P_1 ~\\&~ P_2\\) both are false",
            "image": null
